+
+## Auxiliary source configuration
+
+Craft `332533f` AiSettingsPage keeps decision key source, endpoint and model inside the optional
+AI-purpose section; it does not add TypeSafe/Laya to its ordinary connection picker. Fleet adapts
+this interaction through its existing Provider and Personal owners. Dedicated template creation
+moves to Default models → Auxiliary decisions, without credential migration or record deletion.
+Only System One source forms expose these fields; generic wire-format switching is excluded.
+Existing connection/model reuse remains available under OV-097. Current TypeSafe models/score
+contracts document `jev-1.13.0` and finite rubric scores including fractions. New source defaults
+use the pin while all previous alias records survive. Connection and model writes settle before
+preference binding; an acknowledgement/preference failure retains the committed connection for
+retry, with explicit inference still off. Navigation/unmount/service changes fence delayed binding.
